    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Senior, Design Director level. New York based brand/identity designer (originally from Bangkok). Currently Brand Design at Zora (the crypto/NFT platform; matches Jonathan note Full time at zero = Zora) since 2022; before that at COLLINS NY for ~6 years, rising Associate to Design Director (2021). Known for identity and illustrative/lettering work: Twitch (brand identity and design systems), Crane Paper, Dropbox, Next Insurance, CNET, and Arcane (Riot Games first TV show). Young Guns winner. Approach: structure plus illustration, fluid imagery and mark-making. Autonomy 4: led brand programmes at Director level. Work Status Employed: his own self-maintained site states he is currently at Zora. Links: site jumpjirak.com, IG @jumpjirak, Behance behance.net/jumpjirak, email jumpjirak@gmail.com; no public LinkedIn surfaced. Work shown is largely his COLLINS-era identity work (Crane, Twitch, Arcane).",
